## Patch notes for 2026.159.210

These patch notes summarize the changes from version 2026.156.162.

Added 2 new endpoints:
* Resource.BulkUpdateResources
* WorkSpace.UpdateCurrentWorkspaceSettings

Renamed 2 endpoints:
* Renamed ProjectMembers.UpdateUserProjectMembership to ProjectMembers.CreateOrUpdateUserProjectMembership
* Renamed WorkSpace.RetrieveWorkspaces to WorkSpace.RetrieveCurrentWorkspace

Changes to existing endpoints:
* Breaking change: TaskField.RetrieveTaskFieldValue path changed from `/api/data/tasks/{taskId}/fields/{fieldId}` to `/api/data/tasks/{taskId}/fields/{fieldId}/values`
* Breaking change: TaskField.UpdateTaskFieldValue path changed from `/api/data/tasks/{taskId}/fields/{fieldId}` to `/api/data/tasks/{taskId}/fields/{fieldId}/values`
* Breaking change: TaskStatus.UpdateTaskStatus path changed from `/api/data/tasks/statuses/{taskStatusId}` to `/api/data/projects/{projectId}/tasks/statuses`
* TaskStatus.UpdateTaskStatus added path parameter `projectId`
* TaskStatus.UpdateTaskStatus removed path parameter `taskStatusId`
* Breaking change: TaskStatus.DeleteTaskStatus path changed from `/api/data/projects/{projectId}/tasks/statuses/{taskStatusId}` to `/api/data/tasks/statuses/{taskStatusId}`
* TaskStatus.DeleteTaskStatus removed path parameter `projectId`

Changes to data models:
* IntegrationProviderDto: Added new field `unauthorized`
* ResourceDto: Added new field `roleId`
* TaskDetailsDto: Added new field `baseline`
* UserRolePermissionsDto: Added new field `useMcp`
* WorkSpaceDto: Added new field `accountOwnerId`
* WorkSpaceDto: Added new field `status`
* WorkSpaceDto: Added new field `isActive`
* WorkSpaceDto: Added new field `isReseller`
* WorkSpaceDto: Added new field `licenses`
* WorkSpaceDto: Added new field `settings`
* WorkSpacePermissionsDto: Added new field `changeOwnEmail`
* WorkSpacePermissionsDto: Added new field `useMcp`
* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Added new field `isSocial`


